# 🧾 Document-to-Action Agent

An AI agent that reads receipts and invoices, autonomously reasons about them using **Gemini 2.0 function calling**, and takes real actions — not just answering questions about the document.

> Upload a PDF → Agent extracts data → Checks budget → Logs the entry → Sends alert if over budget → Gives a context-aware summary with your full spending history

![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.10+-blue?style=flat&logo=python)
![Streamlit](https://img.shields.io/badge/Streamlit-UI-red?style=flat&logo=streamlit)
![Gemini](https://img.shields.io/badge/Gemini-2.0%20Flash-orange?style=flat&logo=google)
![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green?style=flat)

