## ⚡ Quickstart

### 1. Clone the repo
```bash
git clone https://github.com/DaniyalchOO7/document-action-agent.git
cd document-action-agent
```

### 2. Install dependencies
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### 3. Set up your API key
```bash
cp .env.example .env
```
Open `.env` and add your Gemini API key:
```
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_key_here
```
Get a free key at [aistudio.google.com](https://aistudio.google.com)

### 4. Run the Streamlit app
```bash
streamlit run app.py
```

Or via command line:
```bash
python main.py path/to/receipt.pdf
```

---

## 🔧 Configuration

### Budget limits
Budget limits are editable directly in the Streamlit UI — no code changes needed. Defaults on first run:

| Category | Default Limit |
|---|---|
| Food | $300 |
| Travel | $500 |
| Office Supplies | $150 |
| Software | $200 |
| Other | $100 |

### Slack alerts (optional)
To receive real Slack notifications when an expense is over budget, add your webhook URL to `.env`:
```
SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL=https://hooks.slack.com/services/your/webhook/url
```
Without this, alerts print to the console. The app works fully either way.

---

## 🧠 Example agent output

**Input:** Receipt from Staples — $187.42 for office supplies

**Reasoning trace:**
```
→ Called: get_spending_summary
  Result: {office_supplies: {spent: 120.00, limit: 150, remaining: 30.00, percent_used: 80.0}}

→ Called: check_against_budget
  Args: {category: office_supplies, amount: 187.42}
  Result: {over_budget: True, overage_amount: 37.42}

→ Called: log_entry
  Args: {vendor: Staples, category: office_supplies, amount: 187.42, status: over_budget}
  Result: {logged: True}

→ Called: send_alert
  Args: {message: Staples receipt of $187.42 exceeds office supplies budget by $37.42}
  Result: {sent: True, channel: console}
```

**Summary:**
> Processed a Staples receipt for $187.42 (office supplies) dated June 14, 2024. This exceeds your $150 office supplies budget by $37.42. Note: you were already at 80% of this budget before this purchase — you have now spent $307.42 against a $150 limit this month. Alert sent.

---

## 🛠️ Tech stack

- **Python 3.10+**
- **[Gemini 2.0 Flash](https://ai.google.dev/)** — function calling + reasoning
- **[Streamlit](https://streamlit.io/)** — browser UI
- **[pdfplumber](https://github.com/jsvine/pdfplumber)** — PDF text extraction
- **[pytesseract](https://github.com/madmaze/pytesseract)** — OCR for scanned PDFs
- **[google-genai](https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai)** — official Gemini SDK

